        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>人间清醒从懂人性开始</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #dcdcd6;\n    font-family: \"PingFang SC\", \"Hiragino Sans GB\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n    color: #1c1c1c;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 34px 26px 20px 26px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n    background: #dcdcd6;\n  }\n  .side-text {\n    position: absolute;\n    right: 6px;\n    top: 190px;\n    writing-mode: vertical-rl;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    color: #b9b9b2;\n    letter-spacing: 3px;\n  }\n  .topbar {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 14px;\n  }\n  .kc {\n    font-weight: 800;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n    letter-spacing: 0.3px;\n  }\n  .pill {\n    background: #1c1c1c;\n    color: #fff;\n    border-radius: 14px;\n    padding: 4px 12px;\n    font-size: 12px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    gap: 6px;\n  }\n  .pill .tong {\n    background: #fff;\n    color: #1c1c1c;\n    border-radius: 10px;\n    padding: 1px 7px;\n    font-size: 11px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\n  }\n  h1.title {\n    font-size: 31px;\n    font-weight: 800;\n    margin: 18px 0 16px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  .banner {\n    background: #1c1c1c;\n    color: #fff;\n    font-size: 20px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 14px 18px;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n    margin-bottom: 20px;\n  }\n  .card {\n    border: 1.5px solid #6f6f6f;\n    border-radius: 6px;\n    padding: 12px 14px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n    background: transparent;\n  }\n  .head-label {\n    display: inline-block;\n    border: 1.5px solid #5a5a5a;\n    border-radius: 5px;\n    padding: 5px 12px;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    background: #d5d5cf;\n  }\n  .row {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-start;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  .icon {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1;\n    margin-left: 8px;\n    flex: 0 0 auto;\n  }\n  p.body {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    margin: 10px 0 0 0;\n    text-align: justify;\n  }\n  p.body b { font-weight: 800; }\n  .placeholder {\n    border: 1px dashed #9a9a94;\n    background: #cfcfc9;\n    color: #55554f;\n    font-size: 10px;\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: flex-end;\n    justify-content: center;\n    text-align: center;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n  }\n  .conform-block {\n    width: 96px;\n    height: 78px;\n    float: left;\n    margin: 4px 12px 4px 0;\n  }\n  .two-col {\n    display: flex;\n    gap: 12px;\n    margin-bottom: 12px;\n  }\n  .two-col .card {\n    flex: 1 1 0;\n    margin-bottom: 0;\n  }\n  .sub-head {\n    display: flex;\n    align-items: center;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n  }\n  ol.factors {\n    padding-left: 0;\n    margin: 10px 0 0 0;\n    list-style: none;\n  }\n  ol.factors li {\n    font-size: 13px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"side-text\">[illegible]</div>\n\n  <div class=\"topbar\">\n    <div class=\"kc\">Knowledge Cards</div>\n    <div class=\"pill\"><span class=\"tong\">TONG</span> 知识分享</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h1 class=\"title\">人间清醒从懂人性开始</h1>\n\n  <div class=\"banner\">每天一遍停止内耗，停止emo</div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"head-label\">随大溜会让人变得平庸吗</div>\n      <div class=\"icon\">💡</div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"placeholder conform-block\">[Illustration: 从众 图标]</div>\n    <p class=\"body\">社会心理学关于从众的定义是，<b>由于群体的压力而改变个体自己的行为或信念</b>。正向，在安静的地方，会不自觉压低讲话的声音；相反，新店开业请一些托儿来排队，制造门庭若市的假象，产生好奇跟着去抢。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"two-col\">\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"sub-head\">\n        <div class=\"head-label\">积极的从众心态</div>\n        <div class=\"icon\">☺</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"body\">有助于学习他人的智慧和经验，修正自己盲目自信的缺点，完善思考方式，扩大视野。</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"sub-head\">\n        <div class=\"head-label\">消极的从众心态</div>\n        <div class=\"icon\">☹</div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"body\">会扼杀个人的独立意识和判断力，束缚思想，使人墨守成规，没有主టे[?]，甚至陷入骗局。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"head-label\">从众≠丧失独立思考能力</div>\n      <div class=\"icon\">☰</div>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"body\">人被外界的信息影响几乎是件不可避免的事情，对多数人来说，从众是一种自我保护和低成本、高效率的决策方式。问题不在于从众，而在于看清自己的真实需求。</p>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"card\">\n    <div class=\"row\">\n      <div class=\"head-label\">影响个体从众的因素</div>\n      <div class=\"icon\">◎</div>\n    </div>\n    <ol class=\"factors\">\n      <li>1.规范影响来自人们希望获得别人的接纳；我们希望得到别人的喜欢。公开反应对社会反应，反映了规范影响的力量。其实不光是人类、动物界，甚至整个生物界也有明显的从众特质。和大多数一样更安全，这几乎成为刻在骨因里的认知。</li>\n      <li>2.信息影响来自他人提供的事实证据。遇到困难的决策任务时从众度也较高，这反映了信息影响的力量，我们希望能正确行事。</li>\n    </ol>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
